	"Description": "OUTDATED MOD! Please note! I don´t plan on modding anymore. But if someone feels like it don't hesitate to change/update and reupload any of my files. I wouldn´t mind it.\n<br />\n<br />Ever wanted strange capsules that aren´t broken? Here we go. The last one isn´t related to Stardew Valley, but I´m a sucker for NGE :P.\n<br />\n<br />All items can be bought at Robins Carpenter Shop (also availabe via Furniture Catalogue).\n<br />[i]\n<br />[/i][i]\u00A0[/i]\n<br />[b]Installation:[/b]\u00A0Just download the file and extract it to your mod folder.\n<br />\n<br />Please note that items may conflict with other installed custom furniture if those were created with Platonymous Custom Furniture Mod! If this happens just open the .json file and change the \"id\" number to something else that isn´t used yet (e.g. 51 to 501).\n<br />\u00A0\n<br />[b]Created with:[/b]\n<br />\n<br />[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/1254]Custom Furniture Mod by Platonymous\n<br />\n<br />[/url][b]Requires:[/b]\n<br />\n<br />SMAPI\n<br />Content Patcher\u00A0\n<br />Space Core\n<br />JsonAssets\n<br />Custom Furniture Mod\n<br />PyTK\n<br />\n<br />Hope you enjoy :)!",
